{
  "uid": "hm-learnbox",
  "title": "learnbox",
  "description": "learnbox (CT 116 on eiyan2), from its own /metrics endpoint on :8080 per docs/SERVICE-CONTRACT.md. Panel notes carry the service-specific reasoning from that repo's CLAUDE.md.",
  "tags": [
    "homelab",
    "service"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Overview",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Uptime",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {},
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "time() - max without(node) (process_start_time_seconds{service=\"learnbox\"})",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "description": "From the Go process collector rather than a metric of the service's own - learnbox exposes no uptime gauge. A reset here with no deploy behind it means the unit restarted, which systemd will have done silently on OOM.",
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Version",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {},
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "max without(node) (learnbox_build_info)",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "{{version}} @ {{commit}}"
        }
      ],
      "description": "From learnbox_build_info. The service and the content ship in the same commit, so this also answers which lessons are live.",
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "name"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Terminal sessions",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {},
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 4
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "max without(node) (learnbox_terminal_sessions)",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "description": "Live PTY sessions. This is a single-user box: a number that stays above one or two across a long idle period means sessions are not being reaped, not that someone is busy.",
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "CPU cap",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {},
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "NOT ENFORCED",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "enforced",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "max without(node) (learnbox_cpu_capped)",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "description": "1 when cpu.max is actually in force on the learner cgroup. Learner code runs as a real shell, so an uncapped box is one runaway loop away from starving the node - this is the panel that says the guard is on, not merely configured.",
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Traffic",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Request rate by route",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (route) (max without(node) (rate(learnbox_requests_total[5m])))",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}"
        }
      ],
      "description": "route is net/http's matched pattern (r.Pattern), so a lesson path arrives as GET /api/lessons/{lang}/{section}/{slug} and 190 lessons do not become 190 series. Requests that match nothing are labelled 'unmatched'. Both nodes scrape this target and each replicates to both stores, so every series exists twice under different node labels; max without(node) collapses the pair before aggregating, where a plain sum would double it.",
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Error ratio",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 6
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(max without(node) (rate(learnbox_requests_total{status=~\"5..\"}[5m]))) / sum(max without(node) (rate(learnbox_requests_total[5m]))) * 100",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "5xx %"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(max without(node) (rate(learnbox_requests_total{status=~\"4..\"}[5m]))) / sum(max without(node) (rate(learnbox_requests_total[5m]))) * 100",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "4xx %"
        }
      ],
      "description": "learnbox labels status with the exact code, not a class, so these are regex matches. A 4xx floor is normal here: the editor polls file mtimes and a 403 from the CSRF header guard is the expected answer to a cross-site POST. Sustained 5xx is not normal.",
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latency p95 by route",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (route, le) (max without(node) (rate(learnbox_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m]))))",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}"
        }
      ],
      "description": "GET /api/term is excluded from the histogram at source - a websocket's duration is the length of the session, which would drag every quantile into the minutes. POST .../check is the slow one by design: it compiles and runs the learner's code under a timeout.",
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Errors by kind",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 14
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (kind) (max without(node) (rate(learnbox_errors_total[5m])))",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "{{kind}}"
        }
      ],
      "description": "host_rejected is the DNS-rebinding guard and csrf_rejected the missing X-Learnbox header - both mean something reached the service that should not have. access_denied is a failed Cloudflare Access JWT; access_unconfigured means a public hostname is being served with no verification configured, which is the one to treat as urgent. disk_full, terminal and ws_accept are local failures.",
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Learner activity",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Checks by result",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 23
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (status) (max without(node) (rate(learnbox_checks_total[15m])))",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}"
        }
      ],
      "description": "passed, failed, error and timeout. failed is the learner's tests not passing, which is the normal state of working through a lesson. error and timeout are the service's problem: a missing toolchain, a harness that will not compile, or a check that ran past its limit.",
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Checks in the last 24 h",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 23
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {},
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (lang, status) (max without(node) (increase(learnbox_checks_total[24h])))",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Which tracks are actually being worked, and how they are going. A track with checks but no passes usually means the toolchain for that language did not install - the C# lessons fail this way when dotnet is missing from PATH.",
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "job": true,
              "instance": true,
              "service": true,
              "kind": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "lang": "track",
              "Value": "checks"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false,
          "reducer": [
            "sum"
          ],
          "countRows": false,
          "fields": ""
        },
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "displayName": "checks",
            "desc": true
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Resources",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 31
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Workspace free space",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 32
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "bytes",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "max without(node) (learnbox_workspace_free_bytes)",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "free"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Free space on the learner filesystem. Below LEARNBOX_MIN_FREE_MB (512 MB by default) readyz reports unavailable and the service refuses new shells and checks rather than letting a full disk turn every write - including the progress file - into a failure at once.",
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Resident memory",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 32
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "bytes",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "max without(node) (process_resident_memory_bytes{service=\"learnbox\"})",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "rss"
        }
      ],
      "description": "The service process only. Learner code runs in its own cgroup under a separate memory.max and does not appear here, so a rise in this line is the Go service itself - most likely the content library or a leaked PTY.",
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
